      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "The fire inspector is inspecting Claude Monet. The kitchen is in chaos. Let's listen closely to their exchange in Russian first, and then walk through each line together.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Шеф, может помочь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "Не знаю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "Меня он оштрафовал.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "Тебя депортировать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "Думаю, что это?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
